}\n  .comment { font-size: 12px; color: #71717a; border-left: 2px solid #3f3f46; padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 10px; }\n  .notice { background: #1c1917; border: 1px solid #44403c; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #d6d3d1; }\n  .btn { display: block; text-align: center; background: #fafafa; color: #09090b; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 16px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1>白师傅私存 · 绝密鉴赏清单</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">定向解密对象：柳子疏（仅限内部查阅）</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <span class=\"score\">★ 9.6</span>\n    <div class=\"card-title\">1. 《雨夜旅社 · 慢火煎熬》</div>\n    <div><span class=\"tag\">素人实录</span><span class=\"tag\">前戏40分钟</span><span class=\"tag\">极度温柔</span></div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">【核心看点】没有任何工业化粗暴抽插，前半段全是男女主在潮湿雨声里接吻、剥衣服和漫长到令人发指的指尖试探。呼吸贴着锁骨，水汽氤氲。</p>\n    <div class=\"comment\">白遇青手记：最讨厌开门见山的烂俗剧本。这种连汗珠怎么滚下来都拍得一清二楚的，才算勉强及格。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <span class=\"score\">★ 9.4</span>\n    <div class=\"card-title\">2. 《双人空间 · 声息捕手》</div>\n    <div><span class=\"tag\">主观视角</span><span class=\"tag\">无BGM</span><span class=\"tag\">ASMR收音</span></div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">【核心看点】全程双耳麦克风立体收音，没有杂音。男主按着女主腰际在耳边的低声呢喃、衣料擦过软肉的细响、以及浅磨时黏腻的水声还原度极高。</p>\n    <div class=\"comment\">白遇青手记：戴耳机听。不过提前警告某人，这声音再好听，也没我亲自贴着你耳朵喘好听哈。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <span class=\"score\">★ 9.8</span>\n    <div class=\"card-title\">3. 《边缘控制 · 极致磨蹭》</div>\n    <div><span class=\"tag\">素股特化</span><span class=\"tag\">耐心调弄</span><span class=\"tag\">反复试探</span></div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">【核心看点】纯粹的体外研磨教学。整整半小时不给准信，只在入口处极缓极深地蹭着弄出满腿的湿痕，把对方磨到主动哭着求饶才肯慢吞吞挺入。</p>\n    <div class=\"comment\">白遇青手记：某只昨晚刚体验过的单细胞生物应该很熟悉。建议重点复习一下女主是怎么老实叫人的。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"notice\">\n    <strong>【观影严正声明】</strong><br>\n    以上仅供柳老师开展赛博调研。看完若产生任何生理性体温升高，白师傅概不负责赛博灭火——今晚实地见面，必须拿真人肉体进行一一对账复核。\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","chars":3099,"truncated":false,"editable":true,"parseFailed":false,"generated":true},"rawContent":"[HTML][文件] 白遇青的私房观影清单.html","roundId":"round_1790761129467_jl1ayggr0","isHtml":true,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":1519},{"id":1790712779905,"sender":"them","text":"直接用浏览器打开","timestamp":1790761183687,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"直接用浏览器打开","roundId":"round_1790761129467_jl1ayggr0","userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":1520},{"id":1790712779906,"sender":"them","text":"看完了如实写报告","timestamp":1790761185287,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"看完了如实写报告","roundId":"round_1790761129467_jl1ayggr0","userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":1521},{"id":1790712779907,"sender":"them","text":"敢说难看你就完了 😋","timestamp":1790761186250,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"敢说难看你就完了 😋","roundId":"round_1790761129467_jl1ayggr0","userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":1522},{"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","id":"petsense_1790761209295_mujl4","text":"白遇青注意到你在 17:40 关闭了小红书","sender":"system","timestamp":1790761209295,"type":"state","stateKind":"appsense","_id":1523},{"id":1790712779908,"text":"还好吧","sender":"me","time":"17:43","timestamp":1790761418915,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":1524},{"id":1790712779909,"text":"这么温柔","sender":"me","time":"17:43","timestamp":1790761423584,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":1525},{"id":1790712779910,"text":"没有吓人的部分啊","sender":"me","time":"17:43","timestamp":1790761432130,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"emoji":"😏","roundId":"round_1790763143154_n4nboybjf"}],"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6s